{"kind": "web_lines", "number": 1, "end_line": 14, "text": "干革命要有阶级感情（一九六七年五月）\n中文马克思主义文库\n->\n毛泽东\n->\n1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》\n301)\n干革命要有阶级感情\n（一九六七年五月）\n要搞好文化大革命就要和工农相结合，要有无产阶级感情，要有工农兵感情。\n（据陈伯达同志一九六七年五月十一日在北京女六中讲话）\n上一页\n目录\n下一页\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-94e8969afd852cfd2dee", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-301.htm", "source_raw_sha256": "22f79c1ad1a88ad06fb191d7ab2840bd20b8393617febcd767c25f24ce40cb54", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-1968", "volume": 5, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "037ef6086a7d8c06979feb903ff2dd68780c52510ed2385ba6048dc09adabdf1", "text_chars": 154}
